WEBVTT

00:16:58.556 --> 00:17:01.476
that we actually get our power
from who we are and our lineage

00:17:01.476 --> 00:17:03.476
and where we come from and our histories.

00:17:03.476 --> 00:17:06.756
What was so fascinating to me
in the 500 women I met and interviewed

00:17:06.756 --> 00:17:09.316
was the pattern that I saw
that the most senior women,

00:17:09.316 --> 00:17:11.676
the ones that really reach
the C-suite or the top,

00:17:11.716 --> 00:17:14.396
a lot of them had told themselves,
"I'm going to conform,

00:17:14.396 --> 00:17:15.756
I'll let certain things go,

00:17:15.796 --> 00:17:18.356
And once I get to the top,
that's when I'll be myself.

00:17:18.356 --> 00:17:20.796
That's when I'll have power
and I'll do it my way."

00:17:20.796 --> 00:17:24.676
And unfortunately, a lot of those women
would share with me they had less ability

00:17:24.716 --> 00:17:27.396
and less power to do it their way
and could less conform,

00:17:27.436 --> 00:17:29.316
less bring in the art, less do the hair

00:17:29.356 --> 00:17:31.396
the way they wanted
at those senior levels,